WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.733
This is Ulm Hollow, a village on a faraway world.

00:00:03.733 --> 00:00:05.716
Nobody here has heard of money.

00:00:06.666 --> 00:00:11.216
This is you, and your family: Gran, Little Tam and Aunt Ola.

00:00:11.216 --> 00:00:13.870
Each night, they need one lumfruit.

00:00:14.221 --> 00:00:19.102
You raise bogwool, two a day. It keeps forever. But nobody can eat it.

00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:23.253
So every morning, you go to the market and swap:

00:00:23.253 --> 00:00:25.804
your bogwool for someone's lumfruit.

00:00:26.153 --> 00:00:30.186
But a swap only works if they want what you have.

00:00:30.186 --> 00:00:35.206
Today, Mira has lumfruit, but doesn't want bogwool. Now what?

00:00:35.956 --> 00:00:40.568
Maybe Sela takes your bogwool for milk, and Mira takes the milk.

00:00:40.568 --> 00:00:43.163
Find the chain, and dinner is saved.

00:00:43.914 --> 00:00:47.893
Sometimes someone at home gets sick. Then they need medicine:

00:00:47.893 --> 00:00:49.981
two driftcap mushrooms from Dov.

00:00:50.831 --> 00:00:55.014
The harvest festival is coming soon. Get there with everyone still at the table.

00:00:55.863 --> 00:00:58.799
There is no money in Ulm Hollow. Not yet.

00:00:58.799 --> 00:01:02.235
Can you keep your family fed until the festival?

